s long had one-sided feelings for Kuze Yukihito, a regular client who often comes with his girlfriend to the restaurant where Tsukasa works. He has given up on ever confessing his feelings, until one day an amazing opportunity arises.\n\n“If you have nowhere to stay, why don’t you come to my place?”\n\nWith this one sentence that Tsukasa utters before he even knows what he's saying, his everyday life changes completely...","year":null,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Boys' Love"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/8a982f07-2bf5-40fd-a5c8-5e979645847b/848243f7-736a-429b-a1e8-f9ce8c0f4601.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.72,"follows":399,"listAt":"2026-10-21T07:08:19.348Z","chapters":[{"id":"395af842-9498-455e-b4e7-01ffc031601f","number":"4","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T16:58:20+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9fd7828a-aee2-451a-8c10-65b59f8a044a","number":"3","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2026-09-15T14:36:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6027454d-2549-4b3a-9f4a-45cbc0e929f6","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2026-08-15T14:52:43+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"938048f9-551d-4e2c-a196-fd43ab10cebc","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":37,"createdAt":"2026-07-09T18:02:28+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:10:23.520Z"},"69567ec2-be6c-44ef-a390-2b2d6dd83ee6":{"id":"69567ec2-be6c-44ef-a390-2b2d6dd83ee6","title":"Kyou mo Café Nanakusa Biyori","altTitle":"Another Great Day at Café Nanakusa","description":"“Thank you, Suzu. I'm glad you were here.”\n\nCafé Nanakusa, located at 793 Hakobera Town, Kogomi City, is a small café run by a kindhearted chef and his loyal brothers.\n\nOne snowy day, a young sheep named Suzu arrives at Nanakusa all alone, having left her family home. She has been struggling with the fact that she is the only member of her family who has never grown horns.\n\nWith the support of Shiro, the café's manager, who looks intimidating and seems cool at first glance but is actually very caring, Suzu begins to experience the warmth of the town's residents at Nanakusa and gradually discovers who she truly is.\n\nMeanwhile, the townspeople, as well as Shiro himself, who came to Nanakusa carrying sorrow from his past, find themselves gaining strength from Suzu's earnest efforts, too.\n\nThis heartwarming story, sure to warm your heart as you read, is finally being released as a full-color book, much to the delight of its fans!\n\nYou won't be able to take your eyes off the slow-burn, heart-fluttering romance between the honest, innocent Suzu and Shiro, who is completely unprepared for the feeling of being lovestruck…!!!\n\nFrom the café staff to the townspeople, every character has their own unique personality, so you're sure to find a favorite!\n\nThe book also features plenty of exclusive, newly drawn manga and illustrations. There's even a story about that popular character that you can only read in this book…!","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/69567ec2-be6c-44ef-a390-2b2d6dd83ee6/dbf16b2f-4f2a-4e12-87d3-e29b900b8f23.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8,"follows":375,"listAt":"2026-10-26T07:10:14.748Z","chapters":[{"id":"7dceaf51-e4fd-4c86-a2bb-9af65a984abb","number":"22","volume":"3","title":"100% Chance of a Soft Bite","lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-10-20T18:42:02+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9b4b4116-9666-42e1-bbf6-7a686e312e4c","number":"20","volume":"3","title":"Stars, Followed by Fur","lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:36:37+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"1f413ec9-54fc-4afe-b1b8-c0e6b2e78f0d","number":"9.9","volume":"1","title":"Shiro & S